lf-contract 0.1
id lf-checked-add/0
word lf-checked-add
ir tests/program/ir/examples.ir
stack ( a b -- sum true | false )
inputs a b
statement For integers a, b in the cell range: if a + b is in the cell range the word returns a + b and true, otherwise false; no addition it performs wraps. Cells below are kept.
case fits(a + b)
  out s true
  ensure s = a + b
case !fits(a + b)
  out false
expect discharged
